# Claws Mail (GTK 3): notifications and tray. Its file dialogs are GTK 3's own (in the process, the
# AppArmor profile decides); GTK 3 would only use the portal with GTK_USE_PORTAL, which would also send
# attachments (GIO file launches) to the portal's OpenFile, which no policy allows. Links: its own
# browser command (the profile's Tor Browser and LibreWolf transitions).
include notify
include tray
